    "body": "**User Story**\nAs an employee (client), I want to only see the menu tabs that are relevant to me so I don't get confused or enter areas that would constitute a privacy breach. \n\n**Tasks**\n\n- [x]  Remove Forms, Applications, tasks, and Dashboards tabs from view for clients in the production and test environment\n\n**Acceptance Criteria**\n\n- [x] Inability to see Forms, Applications, Dashboards, and Tasks tabs from view when logged into the production and test environments as a reviewer\n",
